{"label": "3916a1e40a07d6deabb2", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "ad_read", "referents": [{"word": "my", "refers_to": "the (generic) Bitcoiner's own family/Bitcoin", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [{"text": "If something happened to me", "inside": true}], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Every Bitcoiner must eventually answer whether their family could access their Bitcoin if something happened to them (preamble to the Anchorwatch sponsorship).", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "So, download BitKey today. Use the code WBD for 10% off the second generation Bit Key"},
{"label": "445810538f12ebf89b11~trim", "speaker_changes_inside": "yes", "view": "conditional", "referents": [{"word": "they", "refers_to": "gold and silver (the metals just discussed)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "you", "refers_to": "Mike McGlone (the guest)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "yes"}, {"word": "here", "refers_to": "this discussion / the scenario being debated", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "we", "refers_to": "the market / people in general", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [{"text": "if history is a guide", "inside": true}, {"text": "let's say that you are right here and that we are going to see a bare market at 20% corruption in the stock market", "inside": true}], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "The tops gold, silver and Bitcoin put in recently could hold for decades if history repeats, and, assuming a 20% stock market correction, the question is how far Bitcoin would fall.", "certainty": "speculative", "speaker_is": "uncertain", "speaker_evidence": "What I'm actually arguing here is that basically Bitcoin lately has shown, uh, uh, quite, uh, relatively low volatility"},
{"label": "47d3d30968a793a6f9a8~trim", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "they", "refers_to": "Bitcoin exchange operators", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "it", "refers_to": "dummy in 'whether it's Coinbase'", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "i", "refers_to": "a hypothetical hacker ('if I get in, I get it')", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin exchanges have the most battle-tested security systems because, as bearer-asset vaults, they are the prime target where a hacker who gets in gets the funds.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "the reason Bitcoin you if you're if you're in security in Bitcoin you are you're in the Olympics"},
{"label": "5f40984b34d20c7dc69b", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "it", "refers_to": "dummy in 'whether it be Bitcoin or an equity'", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "you", "refers_to": "the listener / people in general", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Listeners should not let any single holding, whether Bitcoin or an equity, consume all of their thinking.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "but before I sign off, Dan, um, can you plug your YouTube"},
{"label": "6c279c1c2f75d9116c84", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "it", "refers_to": "Bitcoin", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "us", "refers_to": "Bitcoiners / people in the Bitcoin community", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Unlike the traditional sequential phases of money, Bitcoin is simultaneously functioning as a store of value, a medium of exchange, and already a unit of account for many people.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "All right, guys. Well, looks like I'm all alone here"},
{"label": "6fc3cfea365e1845d0b5~trim", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "this", "refers_to": "miners transitioning into AI (described before the selection)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "yes"}, {"word": "we", "refers_to": "Elektron (the speaker's company)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "that", "refers_to": "that Bitcoin mining is a fantastic, profitable place to be", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "It", "refers_to": "Bitcoin mining", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Elektron's thesis is that the AI pivot is good for those pursuing it, but their own modeling shows Bitcoin mining remains a profitable business that radically outperforms over long-term cycles.", "certainty": "likely", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "And I guess the point you're making there is that you see it, you know, from an Elektron perspective"},
{"label": "955704068d8fb8ebaa22", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "We", "refers_to": "Strategy (the company)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "it", "refers_to": "the Binance hack/theft just discussed", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "yes"}, {"word": "the space", "refers_to": "the Bitcoin/crypto industry", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Strategy holds all its Bitcoin with US-based custodians in cold storage, so the Binance hack creates reputational risk for the space but not a direct custody risk to their holdings, though they must stay vigilant.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "'AI is still going to dominate the world,' says Strategy CEO Phong Le"},
